# Journey to Windurst (San d'Oria 2-3, part 1) in Windurst Woods, a level 30 Warrior of San d'Oria with the mission
# current (a GM; a GM's Resonance current keeps RoV 1-1's first mission out). Status 0: Catalia 442, Erpolant 447,
# Forine 446 and Mourices 441 (the zone's own events, not the mission's). Status 3: Catalia 452, Erpolant 454, Forine
# 453, Mourices 451 (the mission's). Status 5: Mourices 451. Status 7: Catalia 452, Erpolant 454 and Forine 453 still;
# Mourices 441 (the zone's own). Status 6: Mourices 456. The login in Windurst Woods also plays SoA's Rumors from the
# West zone-in 839, whose finish sets SoA status 4.
